<title>GERMANY: Bavaria Nov CPI -0.1 pct mt/mt, up 1.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Bavaria Nov CPI -0.1 pct mt/mt, up 1.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state statistics office in the German state of Bavaria reported on Monday the following consumer price changes for November.</p>
<p>    Cost of living		Nov		   Oct</p>
<p>    Month/month (pct change)  -0.1		  unch</p>
<p>    Year/year		     +1.3		  +1.4</p>
<p>NOTE - This data is later combined with data from three other major German states to calculate the preliminary figure for the whole of west Germany.</p>
</text>
